# VirtFoundry

Multi-tenant IaaS platform native to Kubernetes: KubeVirt (VMs), Multus (networks), NetworkPolicy (security groups).

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| API | Go 1.25 + Gorilla Mux + net/http |
| Auth | JWT + API keys (`vfd_live_...`) + IAM (users, roles) |
| Persistence | MySQL (`store.Repository`) or Memory (dev) |
| Hypervisor | KubeVirt (`internal/infra/hypervisor`) |
| K8s ops | `internal/platform/k8s` (tenants, VPCs, NADs, SGs) |
| UI | React 18 + Vite + Tailwind + TanStack Query |
| Deploy | Dockerfiles in `docker/`; Helm in [helm-charts](https://github.com/virtfoundry/helm-charts) |

## Structure

```
cmd/server/          # REST API + WebSocket
cmd/worker/          # Async jobs (deploy_vm, reconcile)
cmd/migrate/         # CloudStack import CLI
internal/api/        # Handlers, middleware, ws hub
internal/service/    # PlatformService (store + k8s + kubevirt)
internal/platform/   # Models, store, k8s manager, branding
ui/                  # React SPA
```

## Conventions

- Go module: `github.com/virtfoundry/core`
- Branding constants: `internal/platform/branding/branding.go`
- Documentation: English; user guides in helm-charts repo MkDocs
- Cluster deploy: `helm-charts` → `helm install` / `helm upgrade`
- Product model: [docs/PRODUCT.md](./docs/PRODUCT.md) (open core + enterprise)
- Terraform provider: blocked until IAM stable — [TERRAFORM-PROVIDER-PLAN.md](./docs/TERRAFORM-PROVIDER-PLAN.md)